Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little\Nmore To get to the answers we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,looking for We came to this new world\Nbelieving That surely someday we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just might find the way All the\Npieces of our dreams have now come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, our bonds won't waver. With
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dreaming hand. Let's head on towards
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future Now\Neverybody lift your hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:01:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming\NAlways stand up Raise up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The flag that you believe in.\NGotta keep up. We'll get past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone that's in our way,\Nlet's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up Keep your head up, way up\Nhigh Always step up If waves are rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,jump to the sky Never give up Our wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,they will come together And\Nlead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the\Nwaves Towards another
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,shore day by day There are many meetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,many goodbyes Underneath the flag we fly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within. I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever. And never take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,lightly But I won't surrender This freedom\NI will keep in mind I'll keep holding on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it Now everybody\Nlift your hands up Sing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about what you are dreaming\NAlways stand up Raise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Up the flag that you believe\Nin. Gotta keep up. We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,get past everyone that's\Nin our way Let's head on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your head\Nup way up high Always step up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,if brains are rough, jump\Nto the sky Never give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,our wishes they will come together\NAnd lead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let us in, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Return Smoker and Tashigi\Nto us or out! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,An airship?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, children, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back home now, safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever run off and make\Nme worry like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the candy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I want the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I need the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you just need to follow the friendly men
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,in the funny suits back\Nto the biscuit room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've left enough candy in there\Nto stuff your bellies full.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to my science lab now,\Nbut I'll see you all very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone behave yourselves and\Ntoddle off to your room and eat as
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,much of the yummy candy as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go take us to our room mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheet man, sure, kids follow me all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,right listen up once you get them all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,inside you lock that door tight And\Ndon't ever let them get out again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,or they'll be hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This place, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with\Nyou, you little br -
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go back to your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hurry so the other kids\Ndon't eat all the sweet candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the -
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bad guy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna put you in that\Nlab and never let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, give me the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to a word he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to trick you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Help me out! I want to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out there and we're\Nnot even on the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go back to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save me, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit slowing us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some kind of\Npunishment for being bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have listened\Nto what they told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a royal pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sanji's body is all banged\Nup and bloody, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful it's so resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Foo's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought me back\Nfrom the brink of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not me, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to sound so disappointed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait. Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been snacking on coffee and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I eat all the cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There were no cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I wasn't snacking on cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer until\Nthe experiment begins?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I hope. Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet, the video, please. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, can't you do\Nsomething about your men?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd keep them on a tighter leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke into a cold sweat when I realized\NSmoker had set foot on my island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's like a wild dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no leash tight enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I find that Sea Prism's stone works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Law, you look fetching\Nin chains. So grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it must have been upsetting to realize\Nyou were helpless against Vergo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The little deal we struck worked\Nout quite handsomely for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll allow you to stay on my island and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,in exchange you'll\Nprovide my men with legs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to add one more condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put you're more powerful than\NI am and to be frank that makes me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,nervous I am the boss of this island\Nafter all so if you wish to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need some insurance I have\Nno intention of causing you harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you need, I'll\Ndo it well. Then. Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How does this sound to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you noticed my dear\Nsecretary Monet sitting over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will entrust you with her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Monet understood, yes, fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And in exchange, I hold on to\Nyour heart for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have ourselves a deal this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have each other\Nby the figurative throat;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it ensures that you won't try anything\Nfunny and allows me to rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always a bad idea to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,put your trust in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you reap what you sow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A tough lesson for you to learn, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about your heart,\NVergo's taking good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know you're a rather shrewd man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but you never thought to\Nworry about my secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, she's not\Nthe woman you thought she was,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and she overheard your entire plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, you okay man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffic, I know exactly what\Nyou were plotting against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed. Law really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I had gone and convinced myself\Nthat I had finally found a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So you clever secretary\Nsaved your hide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I could admit that I should have\Nbeen wary of her that one's on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,me I just didn't expect someone so\Nsmart to work for such a dumbass
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say to me, forest fool.\NYou're kind of amazing. He took your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,heart and you're still alive undone by\Nyour own powers huh that is some record
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-breaking stupidity pathetic what the\Nhell did you do with mine oh do you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,this heart here poor smoke master i've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled up the video\NJust as you instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck is on your side, smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's something projected up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge piece of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, unlawful brokers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for tuning in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A horde of fragmented Smilies are\Ncurrently on route from the Burning Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon enough, they will all converge\Nhere at this central point of the Ice Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon this happy reunion,\Nthey will all merge into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When they do, we'll have one\Nlovely Smiley, huge and deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our experiment will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:11:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my Smiley, he's the living\Nincarnation of the toxic H2S gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've already\Nutilized Smiley once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,four years ago, to kill this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one problem with my last test.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Although they were saturated with poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,my weakened subjects were\Nstill able to evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this time, I've\Ndevised a helpful remedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit of a boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A special meal to stimulate\NSmiley's toxic form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It provides an added effect to\Nhis poisonous composition. One
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that will transform him into a\Nperfect weapon of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to witness the birth of a new\Nweapon—one that I call Land of the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right behind us. Is it even\Npossible to outrun these damn things?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,gaining on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap. It looks like it's\Nfinished forming into one blob.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Perchance, one of you could\Nexplain this beast to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,me What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I hallucinating for fatigue?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a piece of candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how dumb can this day get?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's people down there, beneath it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, we have visual of a\Nlarge, gelatinous creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling it's Smiley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're preparing the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll project the feed\Nonto the fog as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the area once you're done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll want to do it quickly because\Nit's about to get dangerous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon sled should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong? What is that?\NWe've got a problem. There's some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,chemical melting the sled it's\Ncompletely useless now we're stranded
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,how did this even happen where the hell\Ndid this chemical come from it's eating
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,right through the what
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,oh my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,curses i'm so worried for your safety
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,not convincing listen to me you'll\Nhave to run for it your suits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,won't protect you and they'll just\Nslow you down quickly take them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,off and then run to the lab as\Nfast as you can what well if you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,say He wants us to take off the\Nsuit has the master ever been wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows what he's talking\Nabout now do as he says, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a huge floating face now—is\Nit the ghost of a giant well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You quit getting distracted by other crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,crap Just focus on running!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet Smiley!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How I have longed to see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Smiley!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a special surprise for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A delicious snack! Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Smiley, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be patient for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go. Good boy. Obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.36,0:14:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that I'm your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Quest, I've told you to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have so much\Ncatching up to do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There was that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sure, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to eat it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not listening\Nto a word you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Smiley ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallowed the candy hole! It's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Smiley!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them all of your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of ugly baby is\Nit going to be reborn as?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The most powerful weapon\Nof mass destruction ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that is one big frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, crap, it's making\Nall sorts of bad noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do I, but I\Nknow it's something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got to keep running until we\Nget to the lab like a master said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, why'd that stupid\Nsled have to go and break?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a bad feeling about\Nthe way that thing's acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're up that giant candy,\Ngiving a spot of indigestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit speculating and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not noticed the frantic\Nflight of the island's soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, nothing\Ngood can come of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my thoughts exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You have made me so proud of\Nyou, Smiley, until we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, be reborn and arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the ultimate\Nweapon, land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform this island\Ninto a lethal wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with my legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting on us! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the experiment is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have perfected an inescapable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one walks away from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although the poison from my last experiment\Nworked, there were still survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They were ambulatory,\Nable to seek medical aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have immobilized\Nthem from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This new gas smothers the\Nbody in a shell like ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The toxins seep through the skin\Nand instantly paralyze the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the most effective\Nmass-manufactured massacre spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,my toxic death show this world\Nwhat a living hell looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pure madness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're freezing solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like some kind of horror show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All the ones that got wiped out, they\Nlook like Caesar's freak show soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we're not\Nwhere that purple smoke is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think they're filming this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, don't turn around\Nif you haven't figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that massacre happened\Nright behind us—help, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,master
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, if that stuff touches us,\Nwe'll end up like them. We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on an island We can't\Noutrun a cloud of death gas now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it—they sealed up the lab so they\Ncan keep the gas from getting inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the damn door, Caesar,\Nyou heartless bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die on your Frozen Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, damn it, damn you—let us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,about to catch up to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,to us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fall behind,\Nwe'll have to leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down and you're as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can outrun it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of\Nlarge animal up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dragon, a dragon, so it would\Nappear—don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons are from fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're real enough on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but this one looks smaller\Nthan the other one I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap—we can fly on the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we catch it, that's a brilliant\Nidea—then let's do it and do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep running like this—wait\Nup, you fairy tale bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you fairy tale bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all running from the smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at those fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell kind\Nof stupid run is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, the samurai\Ngot his whole body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that means he's not\Ngonna give me his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, that's not\Nimportant right now, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Run faster, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That smoke will freeze you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the strength to yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.46,0:22:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see Prism Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it those are friends\Nof yours, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:23:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that does help to explain\Nwhy they're so difficult to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But their lungs will soon give out\Nand the gas will overtake them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In a mere matter of minutes now, this\Nisland will truly become a land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.40,0:23:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can survive\Noutside of these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one single soul will be left alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, that includes you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I offer you all\Nas proof to the world:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,evidence of the true\Ndestructive power of my land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Dead: a pirate\Nwith 400 million berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a vice admiral of the navy, and\Neven a dreaded Warlord of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all completely helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Against my genius tide of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.61,0:24:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.87,0:24:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do something or\Nhe's gonna kill all my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With these injuries, I'll\Nonly get myself captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that happens, the drug\Nformula and sedatives I found,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll all be for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.62,0:24:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't need any\Nmore close calls today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look who's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.18,0:25:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tashigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, they're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all wrapped in chains! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.66,0:25:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We really are all gonna\Ndie! Smokey! That's Shoujou!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.94,0:25:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They really built that lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As solid as a fortress, very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and rather well designed for\Nmaneuvering heavy equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you two be so relaxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.82,0:25:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we getting out of this jam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting Vergo\Nto show up, but no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.82,0:25:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let a small detail like\Nthat hold us back now, Straw Hat—we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.62,0:25:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we're
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,sticking with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.80,0:26:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't screw it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.46,0:26:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the counter-attack.
